    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval StartUp</strong> is a unique experience blending tavern management, crafting, exploration, and an immersive medieval atmosphere. As the owner of a small tavern nestled in a mysterious swamp, you must balance business development, resource management, and customer satisfaction to thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/aa0c61a7018db3279c2769aab64e3221.poster.avif?t=1755442619\" width=480 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/aa0c61a7018db3279c2769aab64e3221.webm?t=1755442619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/aa0c61a7018db3279c2769aab64e3221.mp4?t=1755442619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Management</strong>: Take charge of every aspect of your establishment, from serving customers to managing stock and staff. Recruit skilled artisans to optimize your productivity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Production</strong>: Turn collected or traded resources into furniture, dishes, and drinks. Unlock new professions like baking, blacksmithing, or farming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Venture into the swamp to gather rare resources, uncover its secrets, and dive into a story rich with hidden mysteries.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Included Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of Captivating Gameplay</strong>: A main campaign featuring varied and engaging activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Activities</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your finances, hire staff, and improve your tavern.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and craft over 50 unique recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate tasks to explore new professions and better serve your customers.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics and Sound Design</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low-Poly Visual Style</strong>: A carefully crafted aesthetic for an authentic medieval experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Lighting</strong>: The atmosphere evolves with the day-night cycle, adding a realistic touch to your tavern and the mysterious swamp surrounding it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features in Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in early access and will continue to grow with exciting new features, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional biomes and areas to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More recipes and items to craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New interactions and quests with NPCs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>Medieval StartUp</strong> and turn your humble tavern into a flourishing institution at the heart of the kingdom!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval StartUp</strong> is a unique experience blending tavern management, crafting, exploration, and an immersive medieval atmosphere. As the owner of a small tavern nestled in a mysterious swamp, you must balance business development, resource management, and customer satisfaction to thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/aa0c61a7018db3279c2769aab64e3221.poster.avif?t=1755442619\" width=480 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/aa0c61a7018db3279c2769aab64e3221.webm?t=1755442619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/aa0c61a7018db3279c2769aab64e3221.mp4?t=1755442619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Management</strong>: Take charge of every aspect of your establishment, from serving customers to managing stock and staff. Recruit skilled artisans to optimize your productivity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Production</strong>: Turn collected or traded resources into furniture, dishes, and drinks. Unlock new professions like baking, blacksmithing, or farming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Venture into the swamp to gather rare resources, uncover its secrets, and dive into a story rich with hidden mysteries.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Included Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of Captivating Gameplay</strong>: A main campaign featuring varied and engaging activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Activities</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your finances, hire staff, and improve your tavern.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and craft over 50 unique recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate tasks to explore new professions and better serve your customers.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics and Sound Design</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low-Poly Visual Style</strong>: A carefully crafted aesthetic for an authentic medieval experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Lighting</strong>: The atmosphere evolves with the day-night cycle, adding a realistic touch to your tavern and the mysterious swamp surrounding it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features in Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in early access and will continue to grow with exciting new features, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional biomes and areas to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More recipes and items to craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New interactions and quests with NPCs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>Medieval StartUp</strong> and turn your humble tavern into a flourishing institution at the heart of the kingdom!</p>",
    "short_description": "Medieval StartUp is a unique mix of tavern management, crafting, and exploration set in a rich medieval world. Manage your tavern, craft unique items, recruit staff, and explore a mysterious marsh full of hidden secrets and rare resources.",
    "supported_languages": "French, English, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain",
    "reviews": "\u201cLots of great ideas for a relaxing low-pixel game to unwind. Farm, build, and optimise your little medieval business. The EA offers a rather promising taste of the game.\u201d<br>Telum Deos<br><br>\u201cA game full of great ideas and very interesting. Easy to pick up, it\u2019s accessible to everyone. Although incomplete for now, it\u2019s already far more complete than some AAA games.\u201d<br>Escadron Griffons<br>",
